Lemma pass_step : forall (ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 s1 a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6 : word)
   (F : bvmap 5 word) fc m (B ia j sh c : Z) (ws : list word) (w : word),
  mem_inv rsegs m -> u32arr rsegs m B ws -> (1 <= ia <= j)%Z -> (j < Z.of_nat (length ws))%Z -> (B + 4 * Z.of_nat (length ws) < 2 ^ 63)%Z ->
  nth_error ws (Z.to_nat j) = Some w -> (bv_unsigned w < 1000000000)%Z -> (1 <= sh <= 29)%Z -> (0 <= c < 2 ^ 30)%Z ->
  a0 = Z_to_bv 64 MAGIC9 -> a1 = Z_to_bv 64 1000000000 -> a2 = Z_to_bv 64 (B + 4 * j) -> a3 = Z_to_bv 64 c ->
  s1 = Z_to_bv 64 (B + 4 * ia) -> s3 = Z_to_bv 64 sh ->
  evt rsegs (fun ms' => exists (x : Z) m',
      ms' = MS (mkR ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 s1 a0 a1 (Z_to_bv 64 (B + 4 * (j - 1))) (Z_to_bv 64 (x / 1000000000)) (Z_to_bv 64 x)
                    (Z_to_bv 64 (x mod 1000000000)) a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6) F
               (Z_to_bv 64 (if (j =? ia)%Z then 0xb07d4 else 0xb07a0)) fc None m' (seg_rom rsegs)
